    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632820/extras/46293c0294f37b4c96ade2e983660f81.avif?t=1744257186\" width=616 height=156 /></span><strong>Daybreak</strong> is a new casual Action Roguelike (Survivor-Like/Bullet Heaven) game featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of characters with unique abilities and designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Sharing Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Copy-and-paste your results and share them with your friends (Wordle-like)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new procedurally generated world each day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, a new level layout is generated. You'll get the same level as everyone else who plays that day.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully-adaptive OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions have an impact on the music! The game features a unique, interactive score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's more to these worlds than meets the eye. Unravel a dark mystery by finding artifacts and messages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We suggest playing Daybreak using a wired DualSense Controller for optimal performance, but the game is fully compatible with DualShock, DualSense, Xbox One, and Xbox Series controllers in Wired and Wireless configurations. Using a compatible gamepad enables an option for haptic efftects.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632820/extras/46293c0294f37b4c96ade2e983660f81.avif?t=1744257186\" width=616 height=156 /></span><strong>Daybreak</strong> is a new casual Action Roguelike (Survivor-Like/Bullet Heaven) game featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of characters with unique abilities and designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Sharing Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Copy-and-paste your results and share them with your friends (Wordle-like)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new procedurally generated world each day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, a new level layout is generated. You'll get the same level as everyone else who plays that day.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully-adaptive OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions have an impact on the music! The game features a unique, interactive score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's more to these worlds than meets the eye. Unravel a dark mystery by finding artifacts and messages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We suggest playing Daybreak using a wired DualSense Controller for optimal performance, but the game is fully compatible with DualShock, DualSense, Xbox One, and Xbox Series controllers in Wired and Wireless configurations. Using a compatible gamepad enables an option for haptic efftects.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Daybreak is an Action Roguelike game where you fight on a procedurally generated planet and try to survive for 5 minutes every day.",
